<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw with TIME AGGREGATION by year,
as scale-county-timeagg-year (<aggregateBy key="Year"/>, <outputtimestep
value="Year"/>; January, April, July and October 2020, both day types, all 24
hours), for the gasoline passenger car (21) and the diesel combination
long-haul truck (62) on road type 1 alone: the PM species (PM10 and PM2.5 totals, EC, OC, NonECPM, sulfate, nitrate,
ammonium, aerosol water, the PM2.5 elements 51-59, PMOTHR, NCOM, TOM and the
residual 121-124) and the PAH particles (23, 68-78, 81-84) at the off-network
exhaust processes -- start, extended idle and APU (2, 90, 91) and crankcase start
and extended idle (16, 17). SulfatePMCalculator writes the PM species from
pmSpeciation and splits the crankcase share onto the crankcase process;
AirToxicsCalculator writes the PAH particles from organic carbon at the same
process (pahParticleRatio). No running exhaust, so MOVES adds no road type. Its non-aggregated twin is scale-county-minor-offnet. County database county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql.
Split from one capture of all seven processes (75,582 rows at one hour), which
the moves.esm evaluation could not hold in memory.]]></description>
